  "summary": "Saratoga Springs, NY, September 16, 2025 – Espey Mfg. & Electronics Corp. (NYSE American: ESP) announces results for its fourth quarter and fiscal year, ended June 30, 2025. For the fiscal year ended June 30, 2025, the Company reported net sales of $43,950,872 compared with $38,736,319 for the fiscal year ended June 30, 2024. Net […]",
